[32m+[m[32m * uniform column edge (right-edge tiling — the field is the whitespace token[m
[32m+[m[32m * that ends there), and everything after the K-th edge is a VERBATIM TAIL[m
[32m+[m[32m * carried through unchanged, spaces included. Padding is reconstructed by[m
[32m+[m[32m * right-aligning each field to its edge. Conforming stretches are found inside[m
[32m+[m[32m * every blank-line block, so headers, arrow rows and odd rows simply pass[m
[32m+[m[32m * through, and several independent grids may exist in one message (the[m
[32m+[m[32m * ΠΟΛΥ- part). A row that does not rebuild is never emitted.[m
