[32m+[m[32m * THE READER (single, local, no dictionary)[m
[32m+[m[32m * -----------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m[32m *     ॥10,3,5,5,9,4,3:149 rows single-spaced, pad field k to width k, rest verbatim.[m
[32m+[m[32m *     drwxr-xr-x 4 root root 128 Jun 15 16:59 ImageMagick-6.9.11[m
